  "description": "CREATE/ALTER/DROP of user databases, tables, views, and procedures (mssql_schema_ddl, 300s). Events come from the default trace (last 4 days, object cap 10000). A zero event count is healthy only when Default Trace is 1. Each event time is mssql_schema_ddl_event_timestamp_seconds (Unix UTC). object_type is database, table, view, procedure, or trigger. Trigger ENABLE/DISABLE is event enabled or disabled. Label event_time is SQL Server local time.",
